OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds against 800-home
OL,4,Agreenbelt development
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 600 residents have joined a
OL,7,Fcampaign opposing plans for an 800-home
OL,8,Fdevelopment on greenbelt land.
OL,10,FThe proposal, which includes a school
OL,11,Fand shops at Church Farm in Claines,
OL,12,FWorcestershire, was unveiled earlier
OL,13,Fthis year by developer Summix.
OL,15,FSpeaking at a Worcester City Council
OL,16,Fmeeting on Tuesday, campaigner Craig
OL,17,FRoutledge said opposition to the plans
OL,18,Fhad continued to grow following a
OL,19,Fpublic meeting held in June.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
