OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds against 800-home
OL,4,Agreenbelt development
OL,5,
OL,6,FWorcester City Council leader Lynn
OL,7,FDenham said government targets remained
OL,8,Fin place but that planning decisions
OL,9,Fwould continue to be assessed on their
OL,10,Findividual merits.
